title:
SMRT long reads and Direct Label and Stain optical maps allow the generation of a high-quality genome assembly for the European barn swallow (
                    <i>Hirundo rustica rustica</i>
                    )

A high-quality genome assembly from a single, field-collected spotted lanternfly (
                    <i>Lycorma delicatula</i>
                    ) using the PacBio Sequel II system
